        "Ulcer or spreading infection under a corn",
        "Black painful toe",
        "Fever with foot infection"
      ],
      "seeDoctorIf": [
        "Painful corns limiting walking",
        "Diabetes with foot skin changes"
      ],
      "doNot": [
        "Do not cut deep into corns if diabetic/poor circulation",
        "Do not invent acid treatments as guaranteed cures"
      ]
    },
    "fr": {
      "summary": "Cors/callosités: chaussures adaptées, podologue. Urgences si ulcère/infection ou orteil ischémique.",
